  npcName: Yangban 1
  requestType: 0
  foodRequestLines:
  - I am rather famished. Would you spare me a bowl of rice?
  medicineRequestLines: []
  foodAcceptLines:
  - "I won\uFFFD\uFFFDt forget your kindness."
  medicineAcceptLines: []
  foodRejectLines:
  - Well, it seems this is how it shall be.
  medicineRejectLines: []
  foodReRequestLines:
  - Please...
  medicineReRequestLines: []
  foodReAcceptLines:
  - You asked again, and I shall honor that persistence.
  medicineReAcceptLines: []
  foodReRejectLines:
  - Twice I asked, and twice denied... I understand.
  medicineReRejectLines: []
  specialLines:
  - "Come to think of it, I noticed you were quite absorbed in that storybook on
    the desk. / It reminded me of something\uFFFD\uFFFD a rather curious matter.
    / There\uFFFD\uFFFDs a man who bought his way into the yangban class, you see.
    / Crude, greedy\uFFFD\uFFFD the very sort of man Dokkaebis seem to favor, wouldn\uFFFD\uFFFDt
    you say?/ I hear even Dokkaebis can starve to death\uFFFD\uFFFD Perhaps someone
    should put that claim to the test."
